@startuml
title Сценарий 3: Обучение (один шаг)

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "ArtificialNeuralNetwork" as ANN
participant "Network" as Net
participant "Layer" as Layer
participant "Neuron" as Nrn
participant "LossFunction" as Loss
participant "Optimizer" as Opt

User -> ANN: train(sample, target, 1 step)

== Фаза 1: Прямой проход ==

ANN -> Net: predict(sample)
Net -> Layer: forward(sample)
Layer -> Nrn: activate(inputs)
Nrn -> Nrn: вычислить взвешенную сумму + bias + активация
Nrn --> Layer: output
Layer --> Net: layer_output
Net --> ANN: prediction

== Фаза 2: Вычисление ошибки ==

ANN -> Loss: compute(prediction, target)
Loss -> Loss: вычислить скалярную ошибку
Loss --> ANN: loss_value

ANN -> Loss: derivative(prediction, target)
Loss -> Loss: вычислить вектор градиентов
Loss --> ANN: gradient_vector

== Фаза 3: Обратное распространение ==

ANN -> Net: backward(gradient_vector)
Net -> Layer: backward(gradient_from_next)
Layer -> Nrn: computeGradient(nextError)
Nrn -> Nrn: delta = nextError * derivative_activation
Nrn -> Nrn: gradient_for_prev = delta * weights
Nrn --> Layer: gradient_for_previous_layer
Layer --> Net: gradient_for_prev_layer
Net --> ANN: backward complete

== Фаза 4: Обновление весов ==

ANN -> Opt: update(layers)
loop для каждого слоя
    loop для каждого нейрона
        Opt -> Nrn: getDelta()
        Nrn --> Opt: delta
        Opt -> Nrn: getWeights()
        Nrn --> Opt: weights
        Opt -> Opt: new_weight = weight - lr * delta * input
        Opt -> Nrn: setWeights(new_weights)
        Opt -> Nrn: setBias(bias - lr * delta)
    end
end
Opt --> ANN: weights updated

ANN --> User: training step completed

@enduml